<title>USA: Respironics Inc to buy German distributor.</title>
<headline>Respironics Inc to buy German distributor.</headline>
<dateline>MURRYSVILLE, Pa 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Respironics Inc said on Monday it has a binding letter of intent to buy its exclusive distributor in Germany, a privately held company called Stimotron Medizinische Gerate GmbH.</p>
<p>The company said Stimotron, with about 32 employees, distributed therapy systems and accessories used to treat Obstructive Sleep Apnea (OSA) and other respiratory disorders.</p>
<p>Respironcs said the deal should close in February.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
